  m_text: "Select one card at a time from specially made draft packs to craft your
    30 card deck. Then play games and receive prizes based on how many games you
    win!\r\n\r\nYour deck cannot contain more than a single copy of a card. Once
    you pick a card you won\u2019t see it again this draft.\r\n\r\nDraft is open
    between <b>1900-2200UTC+1</b> and <b>UTC-4</b> every Saturday and Sunday!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ed9e49faf8158b44aab1c2b3a8c9d3a3, type: 2}
